OL,3,AGrowers going head-to-head at national
OL,4,Agiant veg competition after
OL,5,Aexceptionally hot summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne hopeful grower Derek Hulme says
OL,8,Fthis summer's heatwaves have "played
OL,9,Fhavoc" with his veg, telling the BBC:
OL,10,F"A lot of giant pumpkin and marrow
OL,11,Fgrowers have been devastated because
OL,12,Ftheir veg has split"
OL,14,FSeven Guinness World Records were set
OL,15,Fat the competition in 2025, including
OL,16,Fthe longest aubergine at 49cm (19.3
OL,17,Finches)
